  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So, in VRchat, when many people join a world, FPS goes down significantly, even on really good PCs. This is mostly due to VRchat not having Multithreading support, or support for multiple cores. It uses one core, which is the issue. VRchat would run much better if it used multithreading!",
